  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。パン料理には　欠かせない。ケチャップとも　相性バッチリ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 강한 조미료. 빵 요리에 빠지지 않는다. 케첩과도 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味強勁的調味料。是麵包料理所不可或缺的滋味。和番茄醬也相當搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très épicé qui va très bien avec le ketchup. Le pain fait ressortir ses puissants arômes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein sehr scharfes Würzmittel, das nie fehlen darf, wenn Brot gereicht wird. Es ergänzt sich wunderbar mit Ketchup.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "De sabor fuertemente picante, es un condimento imprescindible allá donde haya pan. Combina de maravilla con el kétchup.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto piccante, immancabile nella preparazione dei panini. Si abbina alla perfezione anche con il Ketchup.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very spicy condiment that’s indispensable when bread is on the table. It pairs tremendously with ketchup.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。パン料理には　欠かせない。ケチャップとも　相性バッチリ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味强烈的调味料。制作面包料理必不可少，与番茄酱乃天作之合。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
